{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2007-deet-science2-19","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2007,"subject":"chemistry","number":19,"points":null,"unitId":"stereo","unitLabel":"유기 구조·입체화학","topic":"R)·E)","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["stereo","organic_rxn"],"stem":"다음은bromobenzene과methyl benzoate를이용하여triphenyl\ncarbinol을합성하는반응식과실험과정이다.\n<반응식>\nO\nOH\n1.\nBr\nMgBr\nMg\nPh\nOCH3\nPh\nPh\n(가)\n2. H3O\nPh\n<실험과정>\n(1) 마그네슘(0.73 g,\n30 mmol)과\n용매\n(가) (15 mL)을(를)\n환류냉각기와dropping funnel이장착된100 mL 2구둥근\n바닥플라스크에넣는다.\n(2) Bromobenzene (4.0 g, 25 mmol)을용매\n(가) (10 mL)에\n녹이고dropping funnel을통해천천히넣어준다음30분\n동안교반한다.\n(3) Methyl benzoate\n(나) 를용매\n(가) (10 mL)에녹이고\ndropping funnel을통해천천히넣어준다.\n(4) 30분동안반응시킨후얼음물(20 mL)에반응용액을붓고\nH2SO4 수용액(6 N, 5 mL)을천천히넣어준후일반적인\n반응마무리(work-up)를수행한다.\n(5) 유기층을모아감압상태에서용매를제거하여얻어진흰색\n고체를차가운헥세인(hexane)으로씻어주고건조시킨다.\n(6) 흰색고체의적외선(IR) 스펙트럼에서\n(다)\n부근에\nOH 기의특징흡수대가존재하는것을확인한다.\n위실험에서(가), (나), (다)에들어갈내용을가장적절하게\n나열한것은?\n(가)\n(나)\n(다)","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032","t033","t034","t035","t036","t037","t038","t039","t040","t041","t042","t043","t044","t045"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"3480 cm－1 무수ether 1.5 g, 11 mmol","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t046","t047","t048"]},{"number":2,"text":"－1 무수ether 3.3 g, 24 mmol 3480 cm","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t049","t050","t051","t052"]},{"number":3,"text":"1735 cm－1 무수ether 3.3 g, 24 mmol","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t053","t054","t055"]},{"number":4,"text":"－1 무수ethanol 3.3 g, 24 mmol 3480 cm","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t056","t057","t058","t059"]},{"number":5,"text":"1735 cm－1 무수ethanol 1.5 g, 11 mmol","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t060","t061","t062"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets"